# Giantfall, first mode: "Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature an opponent controls."
# Its first target must be Bot1's (Bot2's Ornithopter is refused) and its second an opponent's (Bot1's own Ornithopter is refused).
# Bot1's Alpine Grizzly (power 4) deals 4 to Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2), which dies, and takes none itself (one-sided).

